Trademarks
----------

OCPI is a protocol of the EVRoaming Foundation; OICP and Hubject are
trademarks of Hubject GmbH; OSCP is a protocol of the Open Charge
Alliance. This module is not made, endorsed, certified or supported by
any of them and is not affiliated with them; the names are used only to
say which protocols it simulates. oicpsim is a test double, not
Hubject's service; its host names end in .test.

Specifications
--------------

No specification text is reproduced. The OCPI 2.2.1 (CC BY-ND 4.0),
OICP 2.3 (CC BY-SA 4.0) and OSCP 2.0 (CC BY-ND 4.0) documents are used
for facts only, through the evroaming module. The OSCP schemas the
simulator validates with are those embedded, unmodified, in evroaming
(CC BY-ND 4.0, Open Charge Alliance; see that module's NOTICE).

Interop tests (interop/, a separate test-only module)
-----------------------------------------------------

interop/peer/Dockerfile installs extrawest-ocpi 2025.7.16 (MIT,
Copyright (c) 2023 Extrawest, github.com/extrawest/extrawest_ocpi; it
depends on FastAPI, httpx and pydantic, all MIT or BSD-3-Clause) and
uvicorn 0.30.6 (BSD-3-Clause) from PyPI into a python:3.11.9-slim image
at test time; nothing of them is copied into this repository.
interop/peer/app.py is our own script that runs that package.

